The runtime tables in data/ (shipped as turkmorph/data/ inside the wheel) are
learned from the resources below. Because several are CC BY-SA 4.0, the tables
are distributed under the Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0
International license (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/).
No non-commercial (NC) resource is used to build them.

  * Zemberek-NLP dictionaries (lexicon.tsv, proper_words.txt)
    https://github.com/ahmetaa/zemberek-nlp
    Apache License 2.0, Copyright 2018 Ahmet A. Akın, Mehmet D. Akın

  * Universal Dependencies Turkish treebanks, train/dev splits (lexicon additions,
    analysis costs, overrides, underspecified suffix ids, language-id calibration)
    UD_Turkish-BOUN, -Kenet, -Penn, -Tourism, -FrameNet: CC BY-SA 4.0
    https://universaldependencies.org/
    UD_Turkish-IMST (CC BY-NC-SA 3.0) is NOT used for any table; its test split
    is only scored during local evaluation.

  * Universal Dependencies foreign-language treebanks, train splits (langid.json)
    UD_English-EWT, UD_German-GSD, UD_Spanish-GSD, UD_French-GSD,
    UD_Italian-TWITTIRO: CC BY-SA 4.0; UD_Italian-MarkIT: CC BY 4.0

  * BellaTurca corpus sample (wordfreq.tsv, langid.json, lex_bpe.json,
    attested_stems.txt, analysis costs, underspecified suffix ids)
    https://huggingface.co/datasets/turkish-nlp-suite/BellaTurca
    CC BY-SA 4.0
